name: sim.msgBox
description: msgBox instead.
luaSynopsis: int returnValue=sim.msgBox(int dlgType,int buttons,string title,string message)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. dlgType: the message box type.
2. buttons: the buttons to display.
3. title: title of the dialog
4. message: the message to display
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. a message box return value.
